# Model weights — GitHub hard-rejects any single file over 100 MB, and a
# rejected blob anywhere in the pushed history blocks the whole push, not just
# the tip. kokoro-v1.0.onnx is ~310 MB. Re-download these into epub2audiobook/
# instead of committing them.
epub2audiobook/kokoro-v1.0.onnx
epub2audiobook/voices-v1.0.bin
*.onnx
*.safetensors
*.gguf

# Claude Code worktrees / local agent state
.claude/

# Local scratch backups
*.bak-preclaude

# LaTeX build artifacts. Regenerated on every build, and the .log/.fls/
# .fdb_latexmk ones embed the absolute path they were built from. The .pdf
# is the deliverable, so it stays tracked.
*.aux
*.fdb_latexmk
*.fls
*.log
*.out
*.synctex.gz
__pycache__/
*.pyc
